            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kalyn Fahie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I added more seasonings including pepper, onion powder, seasoning salt, all purpose seasoning without salt or Mrs. dash without salt. I also cut my mushrooms in half instead of quarters. Next time I will add breadcrumbs and hopefully that will made them more crispy",
            "datePublished": "2019-02-04T13:03:14.030Z"
