              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "jrkarpp"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I followed the recipe and it came out ok. It wasn't mushy and was crunchy as I like. My only complaint is that it tasted bland so I ended up sprinkling the mushrooms with garlic powder, onion powder and some pepper. I also added an extra teaspoon of garlic salt and pepper to the flour mix for extra favor. Even with the extra salt it wasn't overly salty. I would make theses again.",
